  "prefLabel": "Jus 1602.05 Drop box",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 1602.05 “Drop box” means a double-locked receptacle with an inner lining into which pharmaceutical drugs are deposited, situated in a police station and constructed in a manner that prevents tampering or access by non-authorized persons.\n\nSource. #10177, eff 8-23-12; ss by #13551, eff 2-2-23",
